'''Fireproof Witch''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished from [[Hotspots]] on the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Spawning ==
'''Fireproof Witch''' can be fished up from any [[Hotspot]] on the [[Crimson Isle]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|22}} or higher to be fished up.

[[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

