The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Fireproof Witch''' is {{Green|1,500}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|15.00%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] pool with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

